hbots is the gateway and the Exact client for T3 Code threads.

It runs on T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code) and talks to it over that protocol.
The app is written in Contract and built with Exact (https://github.com/expo/exact, MIT, Expo).
Akeru Bot (https://github.com/opencoredev/akeru-bot) was read for context only; no code is used.

hbots is an independent project, not affiliated with or endorsed by T3 Tools Inc. or Expo.
